counterfactuals.output:
A device for transforming marker positional information between images, comprising:

a feature point detector configured to detect feature points in a first image and a second image;

a marker information storage unit configured to store marker information including positional information of at least one marker associated with the first image;

an inter-image transformation parameter calculator configured to calculate transformation parameters between the first image and the second image based on corresponding feature points detected in the first and second images; and

a marker information transformer configured to transform the positional information of the at least one marker from the first image to corresponding positional information in the second image using the calculated transformation parameters.
